# Limitations and considerations

- Quality depends on the embedding model and the richness of text fields. Short or noisy descriptions reduce match quality.
- Embeddings capture semantic similarity but do not encode explicit hard constraints (like visa requirements or legal eligibility). Use payload filters for such constraints.

